{
  "$comment": "Links that vite's module graph cannot see, for scripts/affected-tests.mjs. `all`: a change to these paths runs the whole suite. `none`: paths no unit or contract test needs to run for (a test that reads one is still selected through its row). `links`, written by hand: a changed path that matches `paths` selects `files` — a test file as it is, any other file (a module) through the tests that import it; a row with `\"scan\": true` adds its files but does not cover the path. `generated`, written by `node scripts/affected-tests-table.mjs` from the test sources and checked by test/unit/affected-tests.test.ts: what each test file or helper reads by path (`reads`, covering) or looks through (`scans`). Patterns: `*` is any characters but `/`, `**` any number of folders. A path that nothing covers runs the whole suite.",
  "all": [
    {
      "paths": [
        "package.json",
        "pnpm-lock.yaml",
        "pnpm-workspace.yaml",
        ".nvmrc"
      ],
      "why": "dependencies and the Node version of every test"
    },
    {
      "paths": [
        "vitest.config.ts",
        "tsconfig*.json",
        "scripts/vitest-electron.mjs"
      ],
      "why": "the configuration of the test run, how each file is compiled, the runner of `pnpm test`"
    },
    {
      "paths": [
        "test/setup-contract.ts",
        "test/setup-dom.ts",
        "test/global-setup-contract.ts",
        "test/global-setup-git-bash.ts",
        "test/flaky.ts",
        "test/flaky-reporter.ts",
        "test/time-scale.ts",
        "test/timings-reporter.ts",
        "test/stale-leftovers.ts"
      ],
      "why": "setup files and what vitest.config.ts loads: they run around every test file"
    },
    {
      "paths": [
        ".gitattributes",
        ".gitignore"
      ],
      "why": "how git checks out and lists every file"
    }
  ],
  "none": [
    {
      "paths": [
        "docs/**",
        ".scratch/**"
      ],
      "why": "documents, tickets and design mock-ups: no unit or contract test reads them"
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "paths": [
        "scripts/affected-tests.mjs",
        "scripts/affected-tests-table.mjs",
        "scripts/affected-tests.table.json"
      ],
      "files": [
        "test/unit/affected-tests.test.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "paths": [
        "test/**"
      ],
      "files": [
        "test/unit/affected-tests.test.ts"
      ],
      "scan": true
    },
    {
      "paths": [
        "harness/bin/**",
        "harness/hooks/**",
        "harness/lib/**",
        "harness/skills/**",
        "harness/agents/**",
        "harness/profiles/**",
        "harness/.claude-plugin/**",
        "harness/package.json",
        "harness/README.md",
        "harness/.mcp.json"
      ],
      "files": [
        "test/contract/harness-scripts.test.ts"
      ],
      "why": "the shell tests of the Harness (harness/bin/tests, harness/hooks/tests), which harness-scripts.test.ts runs, start these scripts and read these texts"
    },
    {
      "paths": [
        "src/main/mcp/*.md"
      ],
      "files": [
        "src/main/mcp/canvas-server.ts",
        "src/main/mcp/browser-server.ts"
      ],
      "why": "imported with ?raw, which the module graph does not follow"
    },
    {
      "paths": [
